{"seq":2,"slug":"classical-models","title":"经典模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arima-family","title":"ARIMA 族模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/arima-family","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"exponential-smoothing","title":"指数平滑方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/exponential-smoothing","wordCount":1549,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"garch-volatility","title":"GARCH 与波动率建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/garch-volatility","wordCount":1484,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"经典模型\">经典模型</h1><p>经典时间序列模型在半个世纪的实证检验中展现了强大的生命力——Box-Jenkins 的 ARIMA 方法论至今仍是工业界预测管线的基准线，指数平滑族以极低的计算成本覆盖了大量业务场景，而 GARCH 族则是金融波动率建模的标准工具。</p>\n<p>本章三篇文档覆盖三大支柱：ARIMA 及其季节性/分数差分扩展、从简单指数平滑到 ETS 状态空间形式的完整族谱、以及从 ARCH 到 EGARCH 的条件异方差模型体系。理解这些经典方法不仅是使用现代自动化工具（如 StatsForecast 的 AutoARIMA、AutoETS）的前提，也是评判深度学习预测器是否&quot;真正更好&quot;时不可或缺的对比基准。</p>\n"}